{"id":"n71080-1-10","stage":3,"title":"유혹 · 诱惑","scene":"社会与交往","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n71080-1-10-1","ko":"어쩌다 네가 남의 돈을 훔친 거니?","zh":"你怎么会偷别人的钱呢？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"어쩌다","meaning":"“어찌하다(怎么会)”的缩略语。","explanation":"어쩌다：“어찌하다(怎么会)”的缩略语。","readings":[{"term":"어쩌다","audio":"/audio/85a8c2b5d5fccc03afbb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91975","senseId":"1","lemma":"어쩌다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어쩌다","audio":"/audio/85a8c2b5d5fccc03afbb.mp3"}},{"text":"네가","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"네가","audio":"/audio/3bd2d2d84b2dc14c59a4.mp3"}},{"text":"남의","meaning":"别人，他人，人家","explanation":"남：别人，他人，人家；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"남","audio":"/audio/e43a28aa552de4826029.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28394","senseId":"1","lemma":"남","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"남의","audio":"/audio/821b74945800951c96f5.mp3"}},{"text":"돈을","meaning":"钱，金钱，钱币","explanation":"돈：钱，金钱，钱币；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"돈","audio":"/audio/a5d79d1c3005908084a4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17204","senseId":"1","lemma":"돈","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"돈을","audio":"/audio/658b47180707ddf8eb38.mp3"}},{"text":"훔친","meaning":"偷，盗，盗取","explanation":"훔치다：偷，盗，盗取；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"훔치다","audio":"/audio/e7f0ceb36466c81e3510.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"87746","senseId":"1","lemma":"훔치다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"훔친","audio":"/audio/f08567ec8fa5037fcf35.mp3"}},{"text":"거니?","meaning":"某种事物、现象或事实。","explanation":"거：某种事物、现象或事实；이다：表示“是”的判断形式；니：非敬语疑问句末，用于亲近的人、晚辈或自问。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62331","senseId":"1","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"거니","audio":"/audio/3e0100c9477501692d3f.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"85a8c2b5d5fccc03","term":"어쩌다","zh":"“어찌하다(怎么会)”的缩略语。","audio":"/audio/85a8c2b5d5fccc03afbb.mp3","entryId":"91975","definition":"“어찌하다(怎么会)”的缩略语。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"734dae8e9d9a8f8b","term":"너","zh":"你","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3","entryId":"64390","definition":"指代听者，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너"]},{"id":"e43a28aa552de482","term":"남","zh":"别人，他人，人家","audio":"/audio/e43a28aa552de4826029.mp3","entryId":"28394","definition":"除我之外的其他人。","pronunciation":["남"]},{"id":"a5d79d1c30059080","term":"돈","zh":"钱，金钱，钱币","audio":"/audio/a5d79d1c3005908084a4.mp3","entryId":"17204","definition":"买卖商品或作为劳动代价支付或收取的硬币或纸币。","pronunciation":["돈ː"]},{"id":"e7f0ceb36466c81e","term":"훔치다","zh":"偷，盗，盗取","audio":"/audio/e7f0ceb36466c81e3510.mp3","entryId":"87746","definition":"统统拿走别人的东西，当做自己的。","pronunciation":["훔치다"]},{"id":"ffcedfda7558e5dc","term":"거","zh":"某种事物、现象或事实。","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3","entryId":"62331","definition":"某种事物、现象或事实。","pronunciation":["거"]}],"audio":"/audio/71233e5d10f80e429b9b.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n71080-1-10-2","ko":"돈에 유혹이 돼서 어쩔 수가 없었어요.","zh":"是被钱诱惑了，所以才忍不住的。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"돈에","meaning":"钱，钱财","explanation":"돈：钱，钱财；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"돈","audio":"/audio/a5d79d1c3005908084a4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17204","senseId":"3","lemma":"돈","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"돈에","audio":"/audio/848442759181d6ec0e3d.mp3"}},{"text":"유혹이","meaning":"诱惑，引诱","explanation":"유혹：诱惑，引诱；이：用在 아니다、되다 等前，标记否定或变化涉及的身份、状态。","readings":[{"term":"유혹","audio":"/audio/0fa49d567eb6af379e0d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71080","senseId":"1","lemma":"유혹","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"유혹이","audio":"/audio/6a8c317b139a37106844.mp3"}},{"text":"돼서","meaning":"受到诱惑","explanation":"되다：受到诱惑（유혹이 되다）；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"되다","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89858","senseId":"20","lemma":"되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"돼서","audio":"/audio/c6c8c7de6c212f9fe8d1.mp3"}},{"text":"어쩔","meaning":"怎么办","explanation":"어쩌다：怎么办；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"어쩌다","audio":"/audio/85a8c2b5d5fccc03afbb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29765","senseId":"1","lemma":"어쩌다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어쩔","audio":"/audio/3c8977ef7207c8bd6446.mp3"}},{"text":"수가","meaning":"可以，可能","explanation":"수：可以，可能；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"수","audio":"/audio/dcd19f5b5caac9771378.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15615","senseId":"1","lemma":"수","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"수가","audio":"/audio/6780a417c9a853af476b.mp3"}},{"text":"없었어요.","meaning":"不能（-ㄹ/을 수 없다）","explanation":"없다：不能（-ㄹ/을 수 없다）；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"없다","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89917","senseId":"11","lemma":"없다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"없었어요","audio":"/audio/2ac65f9511472d67215d.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"a5d79d1c30059080","term":"돈","zh":"钱，钱财","audio":"/audio/a5d79d1c3005908084a4.mp3","entryId":"17204","definition":"财物或财产。","pronunciation":["돈ː"]},{"id":"0fa49d567eb6af37","term":"유혹","zh":"诱惑，引诱","audio":"/audio/0fa49d567eb6af379e0d.mp3","entryId":"71080","definition":"诱使其倾心或做出错误的行为。","pronunciation":["유혹"]},{"id":"91b4dc2748cba787","term":"되다","zh":"受到诱惑（유혹이 되다）","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3","entryId":"89858","definition":"受到诱惑（유혹이 되다）","pronunciation":["되다","뒈다"]},{"id":"85a8c2b5d5fccc03","term":"어쩌다","zh":"怎么办","audio":"/audio/85a8c2b5d5fccc03afbb.mp3","entryId":"29765","definition":"怎么做某事。","pronunciation":["어쩌다"]},{"id":"dcd19f5b5caac977","term":"수","zh":"可以，可能","audio":"/audio/dcd19f5b5caac9771378.mp3","entryId":"15615","definition":"做某事的能力，或某事发生的可能性。","pronunciation":["수"]},{"id":"815560dcd5b82893","term":"없다","zh":"不能（-ㄹ/을 수 없다）","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3","entryId":"89917","definition":"不能（-ㄹ/을 수 없다）","pronunciation":["업ː따"]}],"audio":"/audio/07e3eaae635888aabf70.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.97,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=71080","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":107,"sequenceScore":2.7967,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["你怎么会偷别人的钱呢？","是被钱诱惑了，所以才忍不住的。","你们爸爸的兄弟姐妹关系是怎样的？"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["你怎么会偷别人的钱呢？","是被钱诱惑了，所以才忍不住的。","你们爸爸的兄弟姐妹关系是怎样的？"],"answer":1}]}
